  ('sat.reading-writing', 'standard-english', 'sat.reading-writing/standard-english/agreement', 'mcq', null, 'The apostrophe in ''it''s'' indicates:', '[{"text":"Possessive form"},{"text":"Plural form"},{"text":"''It is'' (contraction)"},{"text":"Emphasis"}]'::jsonb, 2, 'It''s = it is (contraction). Its (no apostrophe) = possessive. Common error: confusing the two.', 2, 'understand', 'all', array['legacy-bank']::text[], 'owned', 'Chapter legacy question bank (Whitespace Studio)', 'Proprietary: Whitespace Studio', 'owned', 'published', 'Imported from the original Chapter app.', 'e681f368cc102bd7744050b70070e70c'),
  ('sat.reading-writing', 'standard-english', 'sat.reading-writing/standard-english/form-structure-sense', 'mcq', null, 'Identify the dangling modifier: which sentence is incorrect?', '[{"text":"Running fast, he won the race."},{"text":"He, running fast, won the race."},{"text":"Running fast, the finish line appeared."},{"text":"He ran fast to win the race."}]'::jsonb, 2, '''Running fast, the finish line appeared'' — the modifier ''running fast'' must modify the subject, but ''the finish line'' can''t run.', 4, 'understand', 'all', array['legacy-bank']::text[], 'owned', 'Chapter legacy question bank (Whitespace Studio)', 'Proprietary: Whitespace Studio', 'owned', 'published', 'Imported from the original Chapter app.', '04b0a1c687604f23b148bfd6770fad02'),
  ('sat.reading-writing', 'standard-english', 'sat.reading-writing/standard-english/agreement', 'mcq', null, '''Neither...nor'' takes a verb that agrees with:', '[{"text":"Always plural verb"},{"text":"Always singular verb"},{"text":"The nearest subject"},{"text":"Both subjects"}]'::jsonb, 2, 'With ''neither...nor'', the verb agrees with the nearest subject. ''Neither she nor they are going'' — ''they'' is nearest.', 3, 'understand', 'all', array['legacy-bank']::text[], 'owned', 'Chapter legacy question bank (Whitespace Studio)', 'Proprietary: Whitespace Studio', 'owned', 'published', 'Imported from the original Chapter app.', '37811cab7eb4a968994fb301cb462f8a'),
